# Cloudflare Pages Redirects Configuration
# SPA fallback - redirect all routes to index.html
/*    /index.html   200

# Optional: Redirect www to non-www (uncomment if needed)
# https://www.your-domain.com/*  https://your-domain.com/:splat  301

# Optional: Force HTTPS (uncomment if using custom domain)
# http://your-domain.com/*  https://your-domain.com/:splat  301

# API endpoints (if you add serverless functions later)
# /api/*    /api/:splat    200